    Below is the complete implementation. You can copy these blocks into your terminal to set everything up.
    
    ### 1. Create the Directory Structure
    ```bash
    mkdir -p ~/Scripts-Apps-Plugins/Scripts/
    mkdir -p ~/.local/share/jellyfin-wallpapers/
